# Hand transcription of Schumann, Album fuer die Jugend Op. 68 No. 1 "Melodie", as printed in the
# Schuberth & Co. edition revised by Karl Klauser ([1867]), p. 3 (Internet Archive b26976821, leaf n2).
# One piano part, grand staff (2 staves): MUST NOT be split into separate parts.
# Both staves use the treble clef; the lower staff of system 1 starts with a bass clef that is
# immediately cancelled by a treble clef before the first note (encoded as a clef change).
# Voice R2 (stems down on the upper staff) exists only in m8 and m16.
# Not encoded: fingerings, slurs, dynamics (p, sf, hairpins), accent/diamond marks, tempo text.
# Pitches cross-checked against the Mutopia Project edition (Peters source) - no differences found.
@title Melodie
@subtitle Album fuer die Jugend, Op. 68 No. 1
@composer Robert Schumann
@arranger Karl Klauser (editor)
@rights Public domain
@source Erstes Album fuer die Jugend Op. 68, Leipzig: J. Schuberth & Co. [1867], p. 3 (Internet Archive b26976821, leaf n2; Gaylord Music Library, Washington University in St. Louis)
@key 0 major
@time 4/4
@timesymbol common
@systems 1 5 10 15
@split Piano=[R R2 / L]
@printed Piano=[R R2 / L]
@clef R G
@clef R2 G
@clef L F

voice R
e''4 d'' c'' b' | a'8 c'' b' d'' c''4 g' | g''4 f'' e'' c'' | b'4 <fis' a'>4 g'4 r4 :|
d''4 c'' b' r4 | f''4 e'' d'' r4 | a''4 g'' f'' e'' | d''8 f'' e'' g'' f''4. d''8 | <c'' e''>4 d'' c'' b' |
a'8 c'' b' d'' c''4 g' | a''4 g'' <b' f''> <c'' e''> | d''8 f'' b' d'' c''4 r4 | d''4 c'' b' r4 | f''4 e'' d'' r4 |
a''4 g'' f'' e'' | d''8 f'' e'' g'' f''4. d''8 | <c'' e''>4 d'' c'' b' | a'8 c'' b' d'' c''4 g' | a''4 g'' <b' f''> <c'' e''> | d''8 f'' b' d'' c''4 r4 |.

voice R2
s1 | s1 | s1 | s1 :|
s1 | s1 | s1 | s2 a'8 c''! b' d'' | s1 |
s1 | s1 | s1 | s1 | s1 |
s1 | s2 a'8 c''! b' d'' | s1 | s1 | s1 | s1 |.

voice L
\clefG c'8 g' f' g' e' g' c' e' | f'8 d' g' f' e' f' e' d' | e'8 g' d' g' c' g' e' g' | d'8 g' c' d' b d' g4 :|
f'!8 g' e' g' d' g' fis' g' | d'8 g' c' g' b g' fis' g' | f'8 g' e' g' d' g' c' g' | b8 g' c' cis' d'4 g' | c'8 g' f' g' e' g' c' e' |
f'8 d' g' f' e' f' e' c' | f'8 c'' e' c'' d' g' c' g' | f'8 a' g' f' e' g' c' e' | f'8 g' e' g' d' g' fis' g' | d'8 g' c' g' b g' fis' g' |
f'!8 g' e' g' d' g' c' g' | b8 g' c' cis' d'4 g' | c'8 g' f' g' e' g' c' e' | f'8 d' g' f' e' f' e' c' | f'8 c'' e' c'' d' g' c' g' | f'8 a' g' f' e' g' c'4 |.
